# Matches the root dagr-mcp package's MANIFEST.in convention: the sdist ships
# the installable package, its license, and its readme. Development-only test
# code is pruned so no partial/broken test tree enters the distribution
# (setuptools' default sdist file-finder only picks up test_*.py-shaped files,
# silently dropping this package's non-test-prefixed test helper module
# (tests/harness.py) and fixture data (tests/golden/) -- pruning tests/
# entirely avoids shipping that half-included, unrunnable state).
include LICENSE
include README.md
prune tests
